title: "crypto-vision"
abstract: "The most comprehensive cryptocurrency API. Real-time prices, OHLCV, order books & market cap for 10,000+ tokens across 500+ exchanges. DeFi TVL, yields & protocol metrics. On-chain analytics & whale alerts. Crypto news & AI sentiment. Historical data. REST, WebSocket & GraphQL endpoints. Python, TypeScript, Go, React, PHP SDKs."
